      "role": "user",
      "content": "been thinking about something lately. you know how the tide goes out? like you watch the water pull back, slowly, over hours. and you don't notice it at first but then you look around and the beach is huge and empty and the water is far away.\n\nthat's kind of what the last few years have felt like. marriage gone, friend died, body started falling apart, work just... stalled. son moved to australia, barely hear from him. none of it happened all at once. just slowly, steadily, going out.\n\nand now i look around and there's just... not much left. it got so quiet.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
